type: software
title: "AskCert: Certifiable Boolean Reasoning under Incomplete Evidence"
abstract: "AskCert is a Python library for certifiable Boolean reasoning under incomplete evidence, returning three-valued (TRUE, FALSE, UNKNOWN) conclusions with supporting certificates and decision-relevant unknowns."
